# Keep the build context lean and the test toolchain out of the image.
# Note the two separate contracts: tests/ must be INSIDE the package, because
# the platform test stage runs pytest against the package root before it builds
# any image, but tests/ must be OUTSIDE the image.
.git/
.venv/
tests/
scripts/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
coverage.xml
.env
*.log
